{"strings": [
  {"text":"Moominpappa at Sea","translation":"Папа и море","where":"game.json title"},
  {"text":"The end of August: everything in the valley is done, and Moominpappa takes his family to a bare island with a dark lighthouse. Each of them looks for a place of their own there — and each finds a loneliness. Whom does Papa notice, and whom does he miss?","translation":"Конец августа: в долине всё уже сделано, и Муми-папа увозит семью на голый остров с тёмным маяком. Каждый ищет там своё место — и каждый находит одиночество. Кого Папа заметит, а кого не заметит?","where":"game.json description"},
  {"text":"A bare island, a dark lighthouse, one lantern for the whole family — and whom will Papa give it to?","translation":"Голый остров, тёмный маяк, один фонарь на всю семью — и кому Папа его отдаст?","where":"game.json line"},
  {"text":"after the novel by Tove Jansson","translation":"по повести Туве Янссон","where":"game.json source"},
  {"text":"The Crossing","translation":"Переход","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"The lantern in the boat","translation":"Фонарь в лодке","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Put it out","translation":"Погасить","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Leave it burning","translation":"Оставить гореть","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Give it to the son","translation":"Отдать сыну","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"The Fisherman","translation":"Рыбак","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"“We are the new keepers”","translation":"«Мы новые смотрители»","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Ask him to breakfast","translation":"Позвать завтракать","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Sit beside him in silence","translation":"Молча сесть рядом","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"We steer by that star. The captain knows the way","who":"papa","translation":"Держим на ту звезду. Капитан знает дорогу","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"The moon’s path. Pretty","who":"papa","translation":"Лунная дорожка. Красиво","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"“Put out the lantern. We’ll go by the stars.”","translation":"«Погасить фонарь. Пойдём по звёздам».","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"“Leave it burning. Mama will wake up and be frightened.”","translation":"«Оставить гореть. Мама проснётся — испугается».","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"“Here. Shine it back, since you’re looking.”","translation":"«Держи. Посвети назад, раз смотришь».","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Put out the lantern. We’ll go by the stars","who":"papa","translation":"Гасим фонарь. Пойдём по звёздам","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Where are we?","who":"mama","translation":"Где мы?","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Where we ought to be","who":"papa","translation":"Там, где надо","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Leave it burning. Mama will wake up and be frightened","who":"papa","translation":"Пусть горит. Мама проснётся — испугается","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Here. Shine it back, since you’re looking","who":"papa","translation":"Держи. Посвети назад, раз смотришь","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"So… a bit to the left… I think","who":"papa","translation":"Так… левее… кажется","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"23 August","translation":"23 августа","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"A keeper always leaves the key. That’s how it’s done","who":"papa","translation":"Смотритель должен оставить ключ. Так всегда делают","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"There’s an arrow here. For fools","who":"my","translation":"Тут стрелка. Для дураков","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Somebody has been here","who":"mama","translation":"Здесь кто-то был","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Gulls","who":"papa","translation":"Чайки","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Enough for three lanterns","who":"mama","translation":"На три фонаря","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"When the wind drops I’ll sail for more. This is going to be our home","who":"papa","translation":"Ляжет ветер — сплаваю. Здесь будет наш дом","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Wind south-west. Nobody again","who":"my","translation":"Ветер зюйд-вест. Опять никто","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"You’ve covered him up","who":"my","translation":"Ты его закрыл","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"He doesn’t need it any more","who":"papa","translation":"Ему уже не нужно","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"“We are the new keepers. If anything happens — you know where to find us.”","translation":"«Мы новые смотрители. Если что — вы знаете, где нас найти».","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"“We have breakfast by the lighthouse. Do come.”","translation":"«Мы завтракаем у маяка. Приходите».","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Sit down beside him without a word","translation":"Сесть рядом, не говоря ни слова","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"We are the new keepers. If anything happens — you know where to find us","who":"papa","translation":"Мы новые смотрители. Если что — вы знаете, где нас найти","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"We have breakfast by the lighthouse. Do come","who":"papa","translation":"Мы завтракаем у маяка. Приходите","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"No need","who":"fisher","translation":"Не надо","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Mamma bakes pancakes…","who":"papa","translation":"Мама печёт оладьи…","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"The sea is good today","who":"fisher","translation":"Море сегодня хорошее","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Good","who":"papa","translation":"Хорошее","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"All done","who":"mama","translation":"Всё уже","where":"bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"The Lighthouse Is Dark","translation":"Маяк не горит","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Papa’s day","translation":"День Папы","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Measure the pool","translation":"Мерить омут","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Carry seaweed for Mama","translation":"Носить Маме водоросли","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Go to the Fisherman","translation":"Пойти к Рыбаку","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Whose lantern tonight","translation":"Кому фонарь на ночь","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Up to the lamp","translation":"Наверх, к лампе","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Mama, with a term","translation":"Маме, со сроком","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"The son, no questions","translation":"Сыну, без вопросов","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"By turns","translation":"По очереди","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"He doesn’t want to","who":"papa","translation":"Он не хочет","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"It’s you who can’t","who":"my","translation":"Это ты не умеешь","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"A lighthouse takes time!","who":"papa","translation":"Маяк — дело долгое!","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Mine","who":"troll","translation":"Моё","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"How beautiful you are…","who":"troll","translation":"Какие вы…","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Measure the black pool","translation":"Мерить чёрный омут","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Go to the Fisherman and ask about the lighthouse","translation":"Пойти к Рыбаку, спросить про маяк","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Nothing will grow here","who":"mama","translation":"Здесь ничего не вырастет","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"It will for me","who":"papa","translation":"У меня вырастет","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Why isn’t he lit?","who":"papa","translation":"Почему он не горит?","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"He shines outward","who":"fisher","translation":"Он светит наружу","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"I’ll understand you. You’ll see","who":"papa","translation":"Я тебя пойму. Вот увидишь","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"The bread was taken","who":"mama","translation":"Хлеб взяли","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"A lighthouse is lit at dusk","who":"papa","translation":"Маяк зажигают в сумерки","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"So light it, then","who":"my","translation":"Так зажги уже","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Take it, take it. I can see well enough","who":"mama","translation":"Бери, бери. Я и так вижу","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Take it, take it","who":"mama","translation":"Бери, бери","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Can I have the lantern? For the whole night","who":"troll","translation":"Можно мне фонарь? На всю ночь","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"What for?","who":"papa","translation":"Зачем?","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"I need it","who":"troll","translation":"Надо","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Night 1, 23/24 August","translation":"Ночь первая, 23/24 августа","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Up to the lamp: “Till I light it, I sleep by the lamp.”","translation":"Наверх: «Пока не зажгу — сплю у лампы».","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"To Mama: “The captain sets a term. Not lit by the full moon — we turn for home.”","translation":"Маме: «Капитан даёт срок. Не загорится до полнолуния — поворачиваем домой».","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"To the son: “Take it. I won’t ask.”","translation":"Сыну: «Бери. Я не спрошу».","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"By turns: “Mama till bedtime, then me, toward morning — you.”","translation":"По очереди: «Маме до сна, потом мне, под утро — тебе».","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Till I light it, I sleep by the lamp","who":"papa","translation":"Пока не зажгу — сплю у лампы","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"“In wind, warm the burner with paraffin till the flame turns blue. Do not let go before.”","who":"papa","translation":"«В ветер горелку греть керосином, пока пламя не посинеет. Раньше не отпускать».","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"The captain sets a term. If it isn’t lit by the full moon — we turn for home","who":"papa","translation":"Капитан даёт срок. Не загорится до полнолуния — поворачиваем домой","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Three nights till the full moon","who":"mama","translation":"До полнолуния три ночи","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Three","who":"papa","translation":"Три","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Home? Where everything’s done?","who":"my","translation":"Домой? Где всё сделано?","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Somebody is crying","who":"mama","translation":"Кто-то плачет","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Let it burn low","who":"mama","translation":"Пусть горит низко","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Take it. I won’t ask","who":"papa","translation":"Бери. Я не спрошу","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"There. That’s for you","who":"troll","translation":"Вот. Это тебе","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Mama till bedtime, then me, and toward morning — you","who":"papa","translation":"Маме до сна, потом мне, а под утро — тебе","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"All right","who":"mama","translation":"Хорошо","where":"bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Mama’s Garden","translation":"Мамин сад","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Mama in the wall","translation":"Мама в стене","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"“She’s out walking” — and up","translation":"«Гуляет» — и наверх","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Call her","translation":"Звать","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"A cup, and wait","translation":"Чашка — и ждать","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Night 2: the hand on the lantern","translation":"Ночь вторая: рука на фонаре","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Don’t open your eyes","translation":"Не открывать глаз","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"“Put it back”","translation":"«Положи на место»","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Go after him","translation":"Пойти следом","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"24 August","translation":"24 августа","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Trees don’t walk","who":"papa","translation":"Деревья не ходят","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"They’re afraid","who":"my","translation":"Они боятся","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Toughening up. Quite right","who":"papa","translation":"Закаляется. Правильно","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Ti-iny, isn’t it","who":"my","translation":"Ма-аленький какой","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"And no Papa","who":"my","translation":"А папы нет","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"He’s at the lighthouse","who":"mama","translation":"Он на маяке","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"That’s new. Wasn’t there this morning","who":"my","translation":"Новая. Утром не было","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Fine","who":"my","translation":"Нормально","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"“She’s out walking. The island is small” — and up to the lamp","translation":"«Гуляет. Остров маленький» — и наверх, к лампе","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Call: “Mamma! Mamma!” — his palm on the wall","translation":"Звать: «Мама! Мама!» — ладонь на стене","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Put a cup of tea by the wall and sit down to wait. Not to move, whoever comes","translation":"Поставить у стены чашку чая и сесть ждать. Не отходить, кто бы ни пришёл","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"She’s out walking. The island is small","who":"papa","translation":"Гуляет. Остров маленький","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Mamma! Mamma!","who":"papa","translation":"Мама! Мама!","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"I only lay down for a moment under the apple tree","who":"mama","translation":"Я просто прилегла под яблоней","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Two more nights","who":"mama","translation":"Ещё две ночи","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Pappa, I…","who":"troll","translation":"Пап, а я…","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Shh. Later","who":"papa","translation":"Тсс. Потом","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"And I found a line here, by the way. The old keeper’s. By myself, under the dust","who":"papa","translation":"А я тут, между прочим, запись нашёл. Прежнего смотрителя. Сам, под пылью","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"How good that you noticed","who":"mama","translation":"Хорошо, что ты заметил","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Night 2, 24/25 August","translation":"Ночь вторая, 24/25 августа","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Up top the camp bed is empty: “I sleep by the lamp” is broken.","translation":"Наверху раскладушка пустая: «сплю у лампы» нарушено.","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Let it burn low. Somebody’s howling","who":"mama","translation":"Пусть горит низко. Воет кто-то","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"“Where are you going? Put it back. I need it.”","translation":"«Куда? Положи на место. Он мне нужен».","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Moomintroll knows that his father knows.","translation":"Муми-тролль знает, что отец знает.","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Where are you going? Put it back. I need it","who":"papa","translation":"Куда? Положи на место. Он мне нужен","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"“The oil is thick: warm it in a pan on the stove, carry it wrapped. On a quiet evening the warm oil runs by itself; in wind — only with paraffin.”","who":"papa","translation":"«Масло густое: греть в кастрюле на плите, нести укутанным. В тихий вечер тёплое пойдёт само; в ветер — только с керосином».","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"“I won’t ask” is broken.","translation":"«Не спрошу» нарушено.","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Up top the camp bed stays empty till morning: “I sleep by the lamp” is broken.","translation":"Наверху раскладушка до утра пустая: «сплю у лампы» нарушено.","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"You promised not to ask","who":"my","translation":"Ты же обещал не спрашивать","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"I didn’t ask","who":"papa","translation":"Я не спрашивал","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Spy","who":"my","translation":"Шпион","where":"bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"The Storm","translation":"Шторм","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Where Papa is in the storm","translation":"Где Папа в шторм","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Light the lighthouse","translation":"Зажечь маяк","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Hold the door with everyone","translation":"Держать дверь со всеми","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"To the Fisherman on the cape","translation":"На мыс к Рыбаку","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"The burner — and run down","translation":"Горелка — и бегом вниз","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Night 3: the paw on his shoulder","translation":"Ночь третья: лапа на плече","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"“Let him go”","translation":"«Пусть идёт»","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"“Mama is right”","translation":"«Мама права»","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"“As far as the dune”","translation":"«До дюны»","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"25 August","translation":"25 августа","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"There’s going to be a storm","who":"papa","translation":"Будет буря","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"With one paw, you might say. Against the wind","who":"papa","translation":"Одной лапой, можно сказать. Против ветра","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"He pulled too","who":"my","translation":"Он тоже тянул","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Your son takes the lantern to the Groke. Every night","who":"my","translation":"Твой сын носит фонарь Морре. Каждую ночь","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Your son took the lantern to the Groke. The one you left him","who":"my","translation":"Твой сын носил Морре фонарь. Тот, что ты ему оставил","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Your son took the lantern to the Groke last night. And you watched and lay there","who":"my","translation":"Твой сын ночью носил фонарь Морре. А ты смотрел и лежал","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Your son took the lantern to the Groke last night. And you snored. Pretending","who":"my","translation":"Твой сын ночью носил фонарь Морре. А ты храпел. Понарошку","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Your son goes to the Groke at night. Without a lantern. He sits there and freezes","who":"my","translation":"Твой сын ходит ночью к Морре. Без фонаря. Сидит и мёрзнет","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Mama was in the wall all day yesterday. She came out when you weren’t there","who":"my","translation":"Мама вчера весь день была в стене. Вышла, когда тебя не было","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"My","who":"mama","translation":"Мю","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Mama knows where the boy goes at night.","translation":"Мама знает, куда сын ходит по ночам.","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Bread again","who":"my","translation":"Опять хлеб","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"The stove’s flooded","who":"mama","translation":"Плита залита","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Full moon","who":"mama","translation":"Полнолуние","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Light the lighthouse with the last of the paraffin","translation":"Зажечь маяк последним керосином","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Hold the door with everyone: “When it drops, we sail home.”","translation":"Держать дверь со всеми: «Стихнет — плывём домой».","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Go out to the cape, to the Fisherman","translation":"Идти на мыс к Рыбаку","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Light the burner — and run down to the door","translation":"Зажечь горелку — и бегом вниз, к двери","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Man overboard. The captain is going","who":"papa","translation":"Человек за бортом. Капитан идёт","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Have you gone mad?","who":"my","translation":"Ты с ума сошёл?","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Where are you going, in such water?","who":"mama","translation":"Куда в такую воду?","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Well, there","who":"mama","translation":"Ну вот","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Be careful out there","who":"mama","translation":"Осторожно там","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"You won’t take it! Do you hear? You won’t take it!","who":"papa","translation":"Не возьмёшь! Слышишь? Не возьмёшь!","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"The oil is warm. Till it turns blue","who":"papa","translation":"Масло тёплое. Пока не посинеет","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Till it turns blue","who":"papa","translation":"Пока не посинеет","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Well. Come on","who":"papa","translation":"Ну. Давай","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"When it drops, we sail home","who":"papa","translation":"Стихнет — плывём домой","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"The captain remembers","who":"papa","translation":"Капитан помнит","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"You’ve told that one","who":"my","translation":"Ты это уже рассказывал","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"I want to go home","who":"mama","translation":"Мне хочется домой","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Pass me the blanket","who":"mama","translation":"Подай одеяло","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"You won’t get me!","who":"papa","translation":"Не дождёшься!","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"On a night like this he ought to burn","who":"fisher","translation":"В такую ночь ему гореть","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"The Fisherman spoke to Papa.","translation":"Рыбак заговорил с Папой.","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"26 August","translation":"26 августа","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"There, you see","who":"papa","translation":"Вот видишь","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"There, there. It’s all right","who":"papa","translation":"Ну, ну. Ничего","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Night 3, 26/27 August","translation":"Ночь третья, 26/27 августа","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Later","who":"troll","translation":"Потом","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Without a lantern? She’ll freeze you","who":"mama","translation":"Без фонаря? Она же тебя заморозит","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Let her","who":"troll","translation":"Ну и пусть","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Where are you going? To freeze again?","who":"mama","translation":"Куда? Опять мёрзнуть?","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"I need to","who":"troll","translation":"Надо","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Tell him","who":"mama","translation":"Скажи ему","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"“Let him go.”","translation":"«Пусть идёт».","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"“Mama is right.”","translation":"«Мама права».","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"“Come on. I’ll go with you as far as the dune.”","translation":"«Пойдём. Я до дюны».","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Let him go","who":"papa","translation":"Пусть идёт","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"She isn’t frightening. She’s just cold","who":"troll","translation":"Она не страшная. Ей просто холодно","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Mama is right","who":"papa","translation":"Мама права","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Come on. I’ll go with you as far as the dune","who":"papa","translation":"Пойдём. Я до дюны","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"I’ll go on by myself from here","who":"troll","translation":"Дальше я сам","where":"bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Epilogue","translation":"Эпилог","where":"bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"27 August","translation":"27 августа","where":"bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"The Beam","translation":"Луч","where":"bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"A week later","translation":"Через неделю","where":"bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"I can now","who":"papa","translation":"Уже умею","where":"bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"“I am forty today. Nobody knows.” Ha. I know","who":"my","translation":"«Мне сегодня сорок. Никто не знает». Ха. А я знаю","where":"bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"The lighthouse shone far. For everyone who was at sea","who":"narrator","translation":"Маяк светил далеко. Всем, кто был в море","where":"bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"A Boat to the Valley","translation":"Лодка в долину","where":"bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"The captain keeps his word","who":"papa","translation":"Капитан держит слово","where":"bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"The captain didn’t light it","who":"my","translation":"Капитан не зажёг","where":"bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"That’s not how it was","who":"my","translation":"Не так было","where":"bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"A Pie on the Cape","translation":"Пирог на мысе","where":"bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"A wave — higher than the lighthouse. And we sit there. Like two rocks","who":"papa","translation":"Волна — выше маяка. А мы сидим. Как две скалы","where":"bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Yesterday it wasn’t like that","who":"papa","translation":"Вчера было не так","where":"bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Today is his birthday","who":"papa","translation":"Сегодня у него день рождения","where":"bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"At last","who":"my","translation":"Наконец-то","where":"bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"I’ll go and wash the tin","who":"mama","translation":"Пойду форму помою","where":"bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Go on, go on","who":"papa","translation":"Иди, иди","where":"bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"“27 August. Quiet.”","who":"papa","translation":"«27 августа. Тихо».","where":"bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"“I am forty today. Nobody knows.” Forty! Old!","who":"my","translation":"«Мне сегодня сорок. Никто не знает». Сорок! Старый!","where":"bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"You shouldn’t have","who":"fisher","translation":"Не надо было","where":"bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Tomorrow will be quiet too","who":"fisher","translation":"Завтра тоже тихо будет","where":"bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Halfway up the Stair","translation":"Середина лестницы","where":"bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Up top and down below. The captain is in time everywhere","who":"papa","translation":"И наверху, и внизу. Капитан успевает всюду","where":"bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"You were everywhere","who":"mama","translation":"Ты был везде","where":"bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Papa sat on the stair. The sea was silent","who":"narrator","translation":"Папа сидел на лестнице. Море молчало","where":"bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"A Quiet August","translation":"Тихий август","where":"bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"How to tell them","translation":"Как сказать","where":"bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"To everyone at supper","translation":"Всем за ужином","where":"bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"To Mama, in the evening","translation":"Маме, вечером","where":"bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"20 August","translation":"20 августа","where":"bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"At the end of August everything in the valley was already done. Papa walked about the garden looking for something to do","who":"narrator","translation":"В конце августа в долине всё было уже сделано. Папа ходил по саду и искал, что бы сделать","where":"bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"Fire! I’ve put out a fire!","who":"papa","translation":"Пожар! Я потушил пожар!","where":"bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"I put out a fire","who":"papa","translation":"Я потушил пожар","where":"bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"A lighthouse. And not lit","who":"papa","translation":"Маяк. И не горит","where":"bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"But somebody must have lived there","who":"papa","translation":"А кто-то ведь там жил","where":"bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"At supper, to everyone at once: “We’re moving to the lighthouse!”","translation":"За ужином, всем сразу: «Мы переезжаем на маяк!»","where":"bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"Tell Mama in the evening, when the children are asleep","translation":"Сказать Маме вечером, когда дети уснут","where":"bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"We’re moving to the lighthouse!","who":"papa","translation":"Мы переезжаем на маяк!","where":"bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"Hooray!","who":"my","translation":"Ура!","where":"bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"To the lighthouse? For good?","who":"troll","translation":"На маяк? Насовсем?","where":"bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"I’ll pack our things","who":"mama","translation":"Я соберу вещи","where":"bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"Is there any earth there?","who":"mama","translation":"Там есть земля?","where":"bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"There’s a lighthouse there!","who":"papa","translation":"Там есть маяк!","where":"bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"All right. I’ll take my paints","who":"mama","translation":"Хорошо. Я возьму краски","where":"bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"You’ve already decided everything. Boring","who":"my","translation":"Вы уже всё решили. Скучно","where":"bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"Leave the candles. There’s a lighthouse!","who":"papa","translation":"Свечи оставь. Там маяк!","where":"bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"And your paints?","who":"my","translation":"А краски?","where":"bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"Something will turn up there","who":"mama","translation":"Там что-нибудь найдётся","where":"bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"22 August","translation":"22 августа","where":"bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"If you keep it, the chapters after this one will have to be played again.","translation":"Если оставить, главы после этой придётся сыграть заново.","where":"bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Drop the replay","translation":"Бросить переигровку","where":"bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Keep","translation":"Оставить","where":"bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Undo","translation":"Отменить","where":"bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Continue the replay","translation":"Продолжить переигровку","where":"bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Back to the main run","translation":"Вернуться к основной","where":"bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Continue","translation":"Продолжить","where":"bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Start","translation":"Начать","where":"bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Replay the chapter","translation":"Переиграть главу","where":"bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Replay from here","translation":"Переиграть отсюда","where":"bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"The author’s map","translation":"Карта автора","where":"bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"continue\nthe game","translation":"продолжить\nигру","where":"bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"start\nthe game","translation":"начать\nигру","where":"bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Finale","translation":"Финал","where":"bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"decided late","translation":"решил поздно","where":"bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"in full","translation":"решил вовремя","where":"bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Replay","translation":"Переигровка","where":"bespoke/map.js"},
  {"text":"continue\nthe replay","translation":"продолжить\nпереигровку","where":"bespoke/map.js"},
  {"text":"the author’s map","translation":"карта автора","where":"bespoke/map.js"},
  {"text":"After Him","translation":"Следом","where":"bespoke/minigames/after.js"},
  {"text":"A boy with a lantern, and steps behind him.","translation":"Сын с фонарём, а за ним шаги.","where":"bespoke/minigames/after.js"},
  {"text":"The Armful","translation":"Охапка","where":"bespoke/minigames/armful.js"},
  {"text":"Seaweed higher than his head.","translation":"Водоросли выше головы.","where":"bespoke/minigames/armful.js"},
  {"text":"Asleep","translation":"Спать","where":"bespoke/minigames/asleep.js"},
  {"text":"A creak, and a hand on the lantern.","translation":"Скрип, и рука на фонаре.","where":"bespoke/minigames/asleep.js"},
  {"text":"The beam goes round.","translation":"Луч идёт по кругу.","where":"bespoke/minigames/beam.js"},
  {"text":"As Far as the Dune","translation":"До дюны","where":"bespoke/minigames/beside.js"},
  {"text":"Two in the moonlight, one a little ahead.","translation":"Двое в лунном свете, один чуть впереди.","where":"bespoke/minigames/beside.js"},
  {"text":"The Boat","translation":"Лодка","where":"bespoke/minigames/boat.js"},
  {"text":"A heavy boat, and two pulling.","translation":"Тяжёлая лодка, и тянут двое.","where":"bespoke/minigames/boat.js"},
  {"text":"The Burner, and Run","translation":"Горелка и бегом","where":"bespoke/minigames/burner.js"},
  {"text":"The Burner","translation":"Горелка","where":"bespoke/minigames/burner.js"},
  {"text":"The burner — and the door banging below.","translation":"Горелка — а внизу хлопает дверь.","where":"bespoke/minigames/burner.js"},
  {"text":"The burner, the storm, and the last paraffin.","translation":"Горелка, шторм и последний керосин.","where":"bespoke/minigames/burner.js"},
  {"text":"Below, the door has banged.","translation":"Внизу хлопнула дверь.","where":"bespoke/minigames/burner.js"},
  {"text":"The flame has turned blue.","translation":"Пламя посинело.","where":"bespoke/minigames/burner.js"},
  {"text":"The Can","translation":"Банка","where":"bespoke/minigames/can.js"},
  {"text":"A full can, and a high threshold.","translation":"Полная банка и высокий порог.","where":"bespoke/minigames/can.js"},
  {"text":"The Door","translation":"Дверь","where":"bespoke/minigames/door.js"},
  {"text":"Pines against the door.","translation":"Сосенки у двери.","where":"bespoke/minigames/door.js"},
  {"text":"Dust","translation":"Пыль","where":"bespoke/minigames/dust.js"},
  {"text":"Dust by the floor, and a line under it.","translation":"Пыль у пола, а под ней строка.","where":"bespoke/minigames/dust.js"},
  {"text":"The Door in the Storm","translation":"Дверь в шторм","where":"bespoke/minigames/hold.js"},
  {"text":"A door, and the sea behind it.","translation":"Дверь, а за ней море.","where":"bespoke/minigames/hold.js"},
  {"text":"Holding Him","translation":"Удержать","where":"bespoke/minigames/keep.js"},
  {"text":"A paw on a small shoulder.","translation":"Лапа на маленьком плече.","where":"bespoke/minigames/keep.js"},
  {"text":"The Knot","translation":"Узел","where":"bespoke/minigames/knot.js"},
  {"text":"A net pulled into a knot.","translation":"Сеть, стянутая в узел.","where":"bespoke/minigames/knot.js"},
  {"text":"The Ladle","translation":"Ковш","where":"bespoke/minigames/ladle.js"},
  {"text":"A thread of smoke out of the moss under the apple tree.","translation":"Дымок из мха под яблоней.","where":"bespoke/minigames/ladle.js"},
  {"text":"Ow","who":"papa","translation":"Ой","where":"bespoke/minigames/ladle.js"},
  {"text":"The Lantern","translation":"Фонарь","where":"bespoke/minigames/lantern.js"},
  {"text":"One handle, and two paws on it.","translation":"Одна ручка, и на ней две лапы.","where":"bespoke/minigames/lantern.js"},
  {"text":"The boy’s paw pulls at the handle.","translation":"Лапа сына тянет за ручку.","where":"bespoke/minigames/lantern.js"},
  {"text":"The Lead","translation":"Лот","where":"bespoke/minigames/lead.js"},
  {"text":"A rope with a weight, and black water with no bottom.","translation":"Верёвка с гирькой и чёрная вода без дна.","where":"bespoke/minigames/lead.js"},
  {"text":"The Match","translation":"Спичка","where":"bespoke/minigames/match.js"},
  {"text":"A wick, a match, and a draught from the gallery.","translation":"Фитиль, спичка и сквозняк с галереи.","where":"bespoke/minigames/match.js"},
  {"text":"The Matchbox","translation":"Коробок","where":"bespoke/minigames/matches.js"},
  {"text":"A matchbox, and a hand that does not take it.","translation":"Коробок и рука, которая его не берёт.","where":"bespoke/minigames/matches.js"},
  {"text":"The palm lies open under the box.","translation":"Ладонь лежит раскрытой под коробком.","where":"bespoke/minigames/matches.js"},
  {"text":"The stone beside him is bare.","translation":"Камень рядом с ним пуст.","where":"bespoke/minigames/matches.js"},
  {"text":"The Mooring","translation":"Швартов","where":"bespoke/minigames/mooring.js"},
  {"text":"A mooring line, and a quiet sea.","translation":"Швартов и тихое море.","where":"bespoke/minigames/mooring.js"},
  {"text":"The boat tugs at the line.","translation":"Лодка тянет швартов.","where":"bespoke/minigames/mooring.js"},
  {"text":"The Palm","translation":"Ладонь","where":"bespoke/minigames/palm.js"},
  {"text":"A painted gate, and plaster under the paw.","translation":"Нарисованная калитка, а под лапой штукатурка.","where":"bespoke/minigames/palm.js"},
  {"text":"To the Cape","translation":"На мыс","where":"bespoke/minigames/pie.js"},
  {"text":"Bread, and the rocks to the cape.","translation":"Хлеб и камни до мыса.","where":"bespoke/minigames/pie.js"},
  {"text":"A pie, and the rocks to the cape.","translation":"Пирог и камни до мыса.","where":"bespoke/minigames/pie.js"},
  {"text":"You’ll drop it","who":"my","translation":"Уронишь","where":"bespoke/minigames/pie.js"},
  {"text":"Over the Rocks","translation":"По камням","where":"bespoke/minigames/rocks.js"},
  {"text":"Rocks, foam, and a lantern in the wind.","translation":"Камни, пена и фонарь на ветру.","where":"bespoke/minigames/rocks.js"},
  {"text":"The Shoulder","translation":"Плечо","where":"bespoke/minigames/shoulder.js"},
  {"text":"The shoulder stirs under the paw.","translation":"Плечо шевелится под лапой.","where":"bespoke/minigames/shoulder.js"},
  {"text":"The Stair","translation":"Лестница","where":"bespoke/minigames/stair.js"},
  {"text":"The middle of the stair.","translation":"Середина лестницы.","where":"bespoke/minigames/stair.js"},
  {"text":"Half a Light","translation":"Полсвета","where":"bespoke/minigames/steady.js"},
  {"text":"Steady","translation":"Ровно","where":"bespoke/minigames/steady.js"},
  {"text":"A low flame, and grey grooves.","translation":"Тусклый огонь и серые бороздки.","where":"bespoke/minigames/steady.js"},
  {"text":"Soot on the wall, and pencil under it.","translation":"Копоть на стене, а под ней карандаш.","where":"bespoke/minigames/steady.js"},
  {"text":"The Thread","translation":"Нитка","where":"bespoke/minigames/thread.js"},
  {"text":"A needle, a thread, and big paws.","translation":"Иголка, нитка и большие лапы.","where":"bespoke/minigames/thread.js"},
  {"text":"The Tiller","translation":"Румпель","where":"bespoke/minigames/tiller.js"},
  {"text":"A star over the bow, and three waves coming.","translation":"Звезда над носом, и идут три волны.","where":"bespoke/minigames/tiller.js"},
  {"text":"Just as planned","who":"papa","translation":"Так и задумано","where":"bespoke/minigames/tiller.js"},
  {"text":"narrator","translation":"рассказчик","where":"bespoke/people.json.narrator short"},
  {"text":"Papa","translation":"Папа","where":"bespoke/people.json.papa short"},
  {"text":"Mama","translation":"Мама","where":"bespoke/people.json.mama short"},
  {"text":"Moomintroll","translation":"Муми-тролль","where":"bespoke/people.json.troll short"},
  {"text":"My","translation":"Мю","where":"bespoke/people.json.my short"},
  {"text":"Fisherman","translation":"Рыбак","where":"bespoke/people.json.fisher short"},
  {"text":"Mama’s garden","translation":"Мамин сад","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Mama in her garden","translation":"Мама в саду","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Mama with us","translation":"Мама с нами","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Mama’s garden — how much she has painted. It grows when she has time alone, it shrinks when Papa is beside her.","translation":"Мамин сад — сколько она нарисовала. Растёт, когда у неё есть время одной, и убывает, когда Папа рядом.","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"The lamp","translation":"Лампа","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Papa at the lamp","translation":"Папа у лампы","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Papa with his own","translation":"Папа со своими","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"The lamp — the sheets by the burner: each one an evening given to the lamp, not to his own.","translation":"Лампа — листы у горелки: каждый — вечер, отданный лампе, а не своим.","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Paraffin","translation":"Керосин","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"A measure of paraffin burnt","translation":"Сгорела мера керосина","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Paraffin — three measures in the can, one full lantern a night. No sailing for more while the crests are white.","translation":"Керосин — три меры в банке, полный фонарь на ночь. За новым не сплавать, пока на море белые гребни.","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"The Groke’s nights","translation":"Ночи Морры","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"A night of light for the Groke","translation":"Ночь со светом для Морры","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"The Groke’s nights — nights she was given light. The more, the nearer she sits.","translation":"Ночи Морры — ночи, когда ей давали свет. Чем их больше, тем ближе она сидит.","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Mama will remember: you decided for everyone.","translation":"Мама запомнит: ты решил за всех.","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Mama will remember: you asked her.","translation":"Мама запомнит: ты её спросил.","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Moomintroll will remember: his father gave him the lantern.","translation":"Муми-тролль запомнит: отец дал ему фонарь.","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"The Fisherman will remember: the new keepers.","translation":"Рыбак запомнит: новые смотрители.","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"The Fisherman will remember: he was called.","translation":"Рыбак запомнит: его звали.","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"The Fisherman will remember: someone sat beside him.","translation":"Рыбак запомнит: с ним сидели рядом.","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Papa promised: “Till I light it, I sleep by the lamp.”","translation":"Папа обещал: «Пока не зажгу — сплю у лампы».","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Papa promised: “Not lit by the full moon — we turn for home.”","translation":"Папа обещал: «Не загорится до полнолуния — поворачиваем домой».","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Papa promised: “I won’t ask.”","translation":"Папа обещал: «Я не спрошу».","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Papa knows the line of 27 August.","translation":"Папа знает строку 27 августа.","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Mama will remember: he turned away.","translation":"Мама запомнит: он отвернулся.","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Mama will remember: he called her.","translation":"Мама запомнит: он её позвал.","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Mama will remember: he waited.","translation":"Мама запомнит: он ждал.","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Moomintroll will remember: “Later.”","translation":"Муми-тролль запомнит: «Потом».","where":"bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Moomintroll has shut himself away.","translation":"Муми-тролль закрылся.","where":"bespoke/story.js"}
]}
